  "description": "1000W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi XC4000 is equipped with a 1000W high-speed brushless motor, offering greater durability than traditional brushed motors. The rear-drive motor delivers strong power, making it easy to climb 30° inclines. With quick acceleration to 25 km/h, it offers smooth riding, and the adjustable rear derailleur allows you to select the ideal gear for different road conditions, ensuring a comfortable ride in pedal assist mode.\n\n48V 17.5Ah Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi XC4000 comes with a removable 48V 17.5Ah Li-Ion battery for convenient storage and charging. With a 840Wh capacity, it offers a range of 120 km in Pedal Assist Mode and 60 km in Pure Electric Mode. The battery's IP54 waterproof rating ensures safe riding, even in wet conditions.\n\nFront Fork Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi XC4000 features an adjustable aluminum fork that improves comfort by absorbing shocks and vibrations from rough urban terrain, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable ride. Its customizable suspension is designed to adapt to various road conditions, enhancing overall riding comfort.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
